  "item.minecraft_armor_weapon.recross_hookshot_long": "§6Re:Cross Hookshot §7(Long)",
  "item.minecraft_armor_weapon.recross_hookshot_short": "§6Re:Cross Hookshot §7(Short)",
  "entity.minecraft_armor_weapon.recross_hook": "Hook",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.welcome.title": "§eWelcome",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.welcome.body": "§7Welcome to The Four Primitives and Weapons.\n\n§fThis book covers:\n§7- Weapon controls\n§7- Skill selection\n§7- Mob info\n\n§8Use the left/right arrows to turn pages.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.launcher.title": "§eKnife Holder",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.launcher.body": "§fRight click: throw\n§7Launches knives in a fan pattern using the selected mode and count.\n\n§fShift + Left click: skill screen\n§7Choose mode and count (1-10).\n\n§cNote: higher count = wider spread.\n§7Snipe = 1 knife / Volley = 10 knives.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.normal_knife.title": "§eSkill: Normal Knife",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.normal_knife.body": "§7Cost: MP 0\n§7Cooldown: 8t\n\n§fStandard throw. Light and fast.\n§7Damages enemies on hit, sticks into blocks for later retrieval.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.stun_knife.title": "§eSkill: Stun Knife",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.stun_knife.body": "§7Cost: MP 25/knife\n§7Cooldown: 16t\n\n§fElectric shock. Applies Slowness + Weakness on hit.\n§7Effective for crowd control but MP-intensive.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.screw_knife.title": "§eSkill: Screw Knife",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.screw_knife.body": "§7Cost: MP 10/knife\n§7Cooldown: 10t\n\n§fBreaks wood/leaves and turns them into items.\n§7Leaves drop saplings/sticks at low chance (bare-hand behavior).\n§7Disappears on wood, passes through leaves.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.mana.title": "§bMana System",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.mana.body": "§7MP regenerates over time (0.1/tick).\n§7Max 100.\n\n§fStun/Screw knives consume MP.\n§7Cannot throw when MP is insufficient.\n§7Check the bar on the left side of the screen.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.common_soldier.title": "§cMob: Common Soldier",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.common_soldier.body": "§7HP: Normal\n§7Attack: Melee\n\n§fBasic early-game enemy.\n§7Normal knives are sufficient.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.elite_soldier.title": "§cMob: Elite Soldier",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.elite_soldier.body": "§7HP: High\n§7Attack: Strong melee\n\n§fUpgraded soldier with better gear.\n§7Stun first, then finish safely.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.singularity.title": "§5Mob: Singularity",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.singularity.body": "§7HP: Very high\n§7Attack: Area\n\n§fBoss-tier foe. Spam 10-knife volleys to bring it down.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.spellbooks_compat.title": "§dMod Compat: Iron's Spellbooks",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.spellbooks_compat.body": "§7When Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks is installed,\n§7this mod automatically uses its mana system.\n\n§f- MP bar shown only by Iron's HUD\n§f- Stun/Screw knives consume Iron's MP\n§f- Mana regen follows Iron's logic\n\n§7No double bars, no double regen.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.katana_saya.title": "§eKatana & Sheath",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.katana_saya.body": "§7Katanas can be stored in a §fSaya (sheath) §7and worn at the hip.\n\n§fBattou (draw): §7Pull katana from sheath and strike instantly\n§fSheath: §7Return the katana to its saya\n\n§7Put the sheath in a §fBOOK §7Curios slot or dedicated slot.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.parry_shield.title": "§bParry Shield",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.parry_shield.body": "§7Nigu Shield. Right-click with correct timing\n§fto parry the enemy's attack and gain §bGuard state§f.\n\n§7While guarding: damage reduction + counter chance.\n§cOn miss: acts as a regular shield.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.test_bow.title": "§2Test Bow",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.test_bow.body": "§7Bow with selectable skills.\n\n§fShift+Scroll: cycle skill\n§fLeft click: activate skill (INSTANT / CHARGE)\n§fRight click: normal shot\n\n§7Current skill name appears above the hotbar.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.magic_books.title": "§5Magic Books",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.magic_books.body": "§fFire / Thunder / Storm / Wind Step / Bubble / Darkness §7etc.\n§7Right-click to cast the elemental spell.\n\n§cEffects:\n§7- AoE damage / knockback / mobility\n§7- Some consume §blots of MP\n§7- Creative mode ignores MP.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.dragon_armor.title": "§5Dragon Armor",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.dragon_armor.body": "§7Full 4-piece sets in several colors (Normal / Green / Black / Red / Blue).\n\n§fSet bonuses:\n§7- Each color grants unique resistances\n§7- Higher durability than vanilla armor\n\n§7Craft with color-specific core material + iron ingots.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.heroic_tier.title": "§6Mob: Heroic Tier",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.heroic_tier.body": "§7HP: Boss-tier\n§7Attack: Melee + special\n\n§fAn upgraded soldier boss.\n§cMelee range = instant kill risk.\n§7Stun + 10-knife Screw volley is the meta.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.angel_trio.title": "§eMob: Angel Trio",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.angel_trio.body": "§7HP: High / Flying\n§7Attack: Ranged + charge\n\n§fThree variants (Serious / Mocker1 / Mocker2).\n§7They fly fast - Homing Knives help you track them.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.blackhole.title": "§8Mob: Blackhole",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.blackhole.body": "§7HP: Very high\n§7Attack: Pull / area\n\n§fSucks nearby entities in.\n§cMelee = suicide.\n§7Stay far and spam Stun knives.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.mob_traits.title": "§cEnemy Buff: Trait System",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.mob_traits.body": "§7Some mobs gain a random trait on spawn.\n\n§fIron Wall: §7+20 armor / 1.5x max HP\n§fBerserker: §7x2.5 atk / faster below 30% HP\n§fSwift: §7x2.0 speed / +16 tracking\n§fRegenerator: §7Permanent Regen II\n§fSpinner: §7Periodic cobweb at target feet\n§fCurser: §7Random debuff on hit (Wither/Blind/etc)\n§fExplosive: §7Small boom on hit, big boom on death\n§fUndying: §7Holds Totem of Undying",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.distance_scaling.title": "§cEnemy Buff: Distance Scaling",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.distance_scaling.body": "§7Enable with /gamerule distanceScaling true.\n§7Mobs grow stronger with distance from spawn.\n\n§f1 level per 500 blocks (cap 20)\n\n§7HP:     1.0 + lv*0.15  (max 4.0x)\n§7Atk:    1.0 + lv*0.10  (max 3.0x)\n§7Armor:  lv*1.0         (max +20)\n§7Speed:  1.0 + lv*0.02  (max 1.4x)\n§7Track:  lv*2.0         (max +40)",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.katanas.title": "§eWeapons: Katanas",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.katanas.body": "§fKatana traits:\n§7- Wide horizontal slash range\n§7- Combine with a §bSaya §7for Battou draw\n\n§fVariants:\n§7- Iron / Gold / Stone §8(basic)\n§7- Netherite §8(durable)\n§7- Magical §8(enchanted)\n§7- Others: straight sword / small / warabiteto",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.swords.title": "§dWeapons: Special Swords",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.swords.body": "§fSwords with unique effects:\n§7- §6Sword of Night §7: charged area slash\n§7- §cRivers of Blood §7: combo buff / blood mist\n§7- §ePrototype Katana §7: high-spec prototype\n§7- §5Kurikaraken §7: elemental sacred blade\n\n§7Check the tooltip when equipped.",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.misc_weapons.title": "§2Weapons: Miscellaneous",
  "guidebook.minecraft_armor_weapon.misc_weapons.body": "§fOther weapons:\n§7- §6Hammer §7: heavy-duty area smash\n§7- §2Scythe §7: wide sweep, slow\n§7- §3Rapier §7: fast thrust, pairs with parry\n\n§7Each has its own motion. Mix and match with katanas/swords.",
